message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the accompanying article."
title: "Quantum-chemical reactivity descriptors add no detectable predictive value to physicochemical descriptors for Helicobacter pylori urease inhibition"
abstract: >-
  Data and code for a controlled comparison of three descriptor blocks — physicochemical/topological, conceptual-DFT global reactivity, and their union — for classifying Helicobacter pylori urease inhibitors, evaluated under random and scaffold-based partitioning.
